  "content": {
    "id": "p29-q07-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "If Tom’s age is squared, it will be equal to his age in 56 years’ time. How old is he now?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "8 years old.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be Tom’s present age in years.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2&=x+56\\\\x^2-x-56&=0\\\\(x-8)(x+7)&=0\\\\x&=8\\text{ or }-7\\end{align*}$$\nReject $x=-7$ because an age cannot be negative. Tom is 8 years old.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 44
  },
